abstract: >-
  An independent exploratory research project concerning complex systems,
  artificial intelligence, long-horizon task quality, and system-level
  behavior. The public edition outlines broad research directions and
  general evaluation approaches. The project remains in development and
  makes no claim of a validated physical law or universal performance
  improvement.
keywords:
  - complex systems
  - artificial intelligence
  - long-horizon tasks
  - system-level evaluation
  - reliability
  - empirical methods
